Type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"Tiantian","textMapHash":3754113914,"text":"Well, um, if you don't mind, could you answer some of my questions about adventurers and commissions?","nextNodeIds":[708140705]},{"nodeId":708140705,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"Tiantian","textMapHash":729338594,"text":"Other than defeating monsters, what other commissions do adventurers take?","nextNodeIds":[708140706,708140707,708140708]},{"nodeId":708140706,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2324042674,"text":"We also help people fix carts and houses.","nextNodeIds":[708140709]},{"nodeId":708140709,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"Tiantian","textMapHash":1089768426,"text":"Whoa, doesn't that just mean that you adventurers do everything? I never knew.","nextNodeIds":[708140710]},{"nodeId":708140710,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"Tiantian","textMapHash":1102277770,"text":"Thank you! I'll make note of it for sure... Ah yes, right. This is your repayment, please take it. It's as generous as can be, you know!","nextNodeIds":[708140711]},{"nodeId":708140711,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"Tiantian","textMapHash":341794258,"text":"Next time you're here to take commissions from me, I'll make sure to give you the best ones!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":708140707,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4118353674,"text":"We help people pick flowers and catch fish.","nextNodeIds":[708140709]},{"nodeId":708140708,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":86554986,"text":"We send takeout and play with children.","nextNodeIds":[708140709]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7081407,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","1331063